  "title": {
    "es": "La torre",
    "en": "The rook"
  },
  "summary": {
    "es": "La torre va en línea recta, tan lejos como quiera.",
    "en": "The rook goes in a straight line, as far as it likes."
  },
  "terms": [],
  "sources": [
    "https://handbook.fide.com/chapter/E012023",
    "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rules_of_chess"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "La torre se mueve en línea recta por "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rank",
            "text": "filas"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " y "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "columnas"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": hacia delante, hacia atrás o de lado, tantas casillas como quiera. Desde "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " puede ir a cualquier casilla de las flechas. Las otras dos piezas son los reyes: de momento, no te fijes en ellos."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The rook moves in a straight line along "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rank",
            "text": "ranks"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "files"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": forwards, backwards or sideways, as many squares as it likes. From "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " it can go to any square along the arrows. The other two pieces are the kings: ignore them for now."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "4k3/8/8/8/3R4/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1",
        "orientation": "white",
        "arrows": [
          {
            "from": "d4",
            "to": "d8"
          },
          {
            "from": "d4",
            "to": "d1"
          },
          {
            "from": "d4",
            "to": "a4"
          },
          {
            "from": "d4",
            "to": "h4"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "reach",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Recoge las estrellas con la torre, en el orden que quieras. Cada jugada puede ser tan larga como quieras, así que intenta usar pocas: el contador te dice el mínimo."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Collect the stars with the rook, in any order. Each move can be as long as you like, so try to use few: the counter tells you the minimum."
          }
        ]
      },
      "piece": {
        "role": "rook",
        "color": "white",
        "square": "a1"
      },
      "targets": [
        "a6",
        "f6",
        "f2"
      ],
      "minMoves": 3,
      "hint": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Sube primero por la "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "columna"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " hasta la estrella de arriba y luego ve de lado."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "First go up the "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "file"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " to the top star, then go sideways."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "La torre no puede saltar. Si una pieza de su mismo color le corta el paso, se para antes: aquí el peón blanco de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " no la deja pasar de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Las casillas marcadas son todas las que tiene."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The rook cannot jump. If a piece of its own colour is in the way, it stops before it: here the white pawn on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " does not let it past "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". The marked squares are all the ones it has."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "4k3/8/3P4/8/3R4/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1",
        "orientation": "white",
        "highlights": [
          "d5",
          "d3",
          "d2",
          "d1",
          "a4",
          "b4",
          "c4",
          "e4",
          "f4",
          "g4",
          "h4"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "reach",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Ahora hay peones blancos que no se mueven. La torre no puede pisarlos ni pasar por encima. Busca otro camino hasta la estrella."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Now there are white pawns that do not move. The rook cannot step on them or pass over them. Find another way to the star."
          }
        ]
      },
      "piece": {
        "role": "rook",
        "color": "white",
        "square": "a1"
      },
      "targets": [
        "a8"
      ],
      "blockers": [
        "a4",
        "c1"
      ],
      "minMoves": 3,
      "hint": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Por su "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "columna"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " no puede subir. Da un paso a la derecha y sube por la columna de al lado."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "It cannot go up its own "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "file"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Take one step right and go up the next file."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Una pieza rival ataca casillas: si tu torre se para en una de ellas, la rival se la come. La torre negra de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "c5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " ataca su "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rank",
            "text": "fila"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " y su "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "columna"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", que son las casillas marcadas. Puedes pasar por ellas en mitad de una jugada; lo que no puedes es pararte."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "A rival piece attacks squares: if your rook stops on one of them, the rival takes it. The black rook on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "c5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " attacks its "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rank",
            "text": "rank"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and its "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "file"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", which are the marked squares. You can pass through them in the middle of a move; what you cannot do is stop on them."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "4k3/8/8/2r5/8/8/8/R3K3 w - - 0 1",
        "orientation": "white",
        "highlights": [
          "c1",
