          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " d. Cruzarlas en mitad de una jugada sí vale."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Avoid "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rank",
            "text": "rank"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 5 and the d "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "file"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Crossing them in the middle of a move is fine."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Resumen: la torre va en línea recta por "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rank",
            "text": "filas"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " y "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "columnas"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", tan lejos como quiera, y no salta. No puede pararse en una casilla atacada sin que la capturen. Cada bando empieza con dos torres, en las esquinas: las marcadas."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Summary: the rook goes in a straight line along "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "rank",
            "text": "ranks"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "file",
            "text": "files"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", as far as it likes, and it does not jump. It cannot stop on an attacked square without being captured. Each side starts with two rooks, in the corners: the marked ones."
          }
        ]
      },
